# The C Stage0 in bootstrap/ is frozen: its sources do not change. It compiles
# the compiler of one pinned commit, and the release check (bootstrap/chain.sh,
# bootstrap/chain.ps1, .github/workflows/chain.yml) climbs from there to the
# current sources:
#
#   stage0 COMMIT   the commit whose compiler/ and library/ the C Stage0
#                   compiles (the commit the frozen Stage0 was last tested
#                   with; tagged)
#   step COMMIT     optional, in order: the compiler of COMMIT, built by the
#                   compiler of the line before. A step is needed once the
#                   current sources use a feature the previous step's compiler
#                   lacks (a seed bump that let the compiler use a feature adds
#                   the seed-bump commit here when the chain needs it).
#
# The chain's last compiler builds the current sources, that compiler builds
# them again, and the result must be byte-identical to what the seed route
# builds (a diverse double-compile: two independent roots, one compiler).
